Package: spotlight
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xwayland
Description: Presenter spotlight for the Logitech Spotlight on GNOME
 Hold the top button on the Logitech Spotlight and move it: the screen dims
 except for a circle around the pointer. Let go, and it disappears.
 .
 Works on GNOME (Wayland) via XWayland override-redirect windows, with a
 libadwaita settings window. Includes a udev rule that lets the logged-in
 user read the Spotlight's input events.
